MobileNet v4 (mobilenet-v4-small, mobilenet-v4-medium)

Weights by Google, taken from the timm checkpoints
timm/mobilenetv4_conv_small.e2400_r224_in1k and
timm/mobilenetv4_conv_medium.e500_r224_in1k via the ONNX exports published by
onnx-community, and converted to TensorFlow.js here.

